{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High above, a rift slowly tears open. Below the city walls, countless enemy troops breach the gates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Warmaster of the Bahar Empire, returning to the beginning of the conflict, attempting to change everything from its source\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lead Your Men-at-arms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alongside diverse regiments and immerse yourself in medieval-style fantasy battlefields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/aab0cd9dcf48eec6e18167cbb9588a66.poster.avif?t=1772560684\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/aab0cd9dcf48eec6e18167cbb9588a66.webm?t=1772560684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/aab0cd9dcf48eec6e18167cbb9588a66.mp4?t=1772560684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical View VS Third-Person View</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slaughter the enemies with your own hand as the warmaster, or plan your troops precisely under Tactical view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/1e9c16275e044bfc675a170cf5134821.poster.avif?t=1772560684\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/1e9c16275e044bfc675a170cf5134821.webm?t=1772560684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/1e9c16275e044bfc675a170cf5134821.mp4?t=1772560684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hero Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Warmaster unlocks powerful skills as the expedition advances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/a2cd35362dcc57d1b009e8ee292a17ac.poster.avif?t=1772560684\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/a2cd35362dcc57d1b009e8ee292a17ac.webm?t=1772560684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/a2cd35362dcc57d1b009e8ee292a17ac.mp4?t=1772560684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelite Regiment Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanently enhance your regiments through the talent tree and acquire powerful upgrades during each expedition. Fire? Explosions? Poison? The choice is yours.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/e81a64bffcb119c70887471e79dfa574.avif?t=1772560684\" width=640 height=169 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gear System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge higher difficulty expeditions to obtain even stronger equipment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Us</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are a small team that contains only 2 full-time devs and 1 part-time dev, and we really need community feedback to inprove our game. Join our Discord and talk to us!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2723670?t=1772560684","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2723670?t=1772560684","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/510dafae41b3e0fc2af788d9797126995ded8c92/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772560684","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/510dafae41b3e0fc2af788d9797126995ded8c92/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772560684","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>About the playtest</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playtest dropping soon!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't want to miss out? <strong>Wishlist and follow</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.poster.avif?t=1772560684\" width=800 height=66 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.webm?t=1772560684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.mp4?t=1772560684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join our Discord</strong> to stay up-to-date with development progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High above, a rift slowly tears open. Below the city walls, countless enemy troops breach the gates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Warmaster of the Bahar Empire, returning to the beginning of the conflict, attempting to change everything from its source\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lead Your Men-at-arms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alongside diverse regiments and immerse yourself in medieval-style fantasy battlefields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/aab0cd9dcf48eec6e18167cbb9588a66.poster.avif?t=1772560684\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/aab0cd9dcf48eec6e18167cbb9588a66.webm?t=1772560684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/aab0cd9dcf48eec6e18167cbb9588a66.mp4?t=1772560684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical View VS Third-Person View</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slaughter the enemies with your own hand as the warmaster, or plan your troops precisely under Tactical view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/1e9c16275e044bfc675a170cf5134821.poster.avif?t=1772560684\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/1e9c16275e044bfc675a170cf5134821.webm?t=1772560684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/1e9c16275e044bfc675a170cf5134821.mp4?t=1772560684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hero Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Warmaster unlocks powerful skills as the expedition advances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/a2cd35362dcc57d1b009e8ee292a17ac.poster.avif?t=1772560684\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/a2cd35362dcc57d1b009e8ee292a17ac.webm?t=1772560684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/a2cd35362dcc57d1b009e8ee292a17ac.mp4?t=1772560684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelite Regiment Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanently enhance your regiments through the talent tree and acquire powerful upgrades during each expedition. Fire? Explosions? Poison? The choice is yours.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/extras/e81a64bffcb119c70887471e79dfa574.avif?t=1772560684\" width=640 height=169 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gear System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge higher difficulty expeditions to obtain even stronger equipment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Us</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are a small team that contains only 2 full-time devs and 1 part-time dev, and we really need community feedback to inprove our game. Join our Discord and talk to us!</p>","developers":["Bumeow Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723670/e209cfa851a31b873f05d0b27300f56ac12db9ed/header.jpg?t=1772560684","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2723670/2072357138/e215fa